      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Captain Laila Nasser. My helicopter is ready at the eastern landing area. Bring the four specialists to me in the APC; I can keep this extraction window open for ten minutes.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.36,
      "sha256": "13c87a79999457e8fcb1e09a384524b13b435aa473ef3b6c4d4d7e6ad12909b6",
      "captionSha256": "57553ec02ff55b9687393948656fa3f0035e190b45d9cf4c68033decdaaf11bc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "سروان لیلا ناصر هستم. بالگردم در محل فرود شرقی آماده است. چهار متخصص را با نفربر به من برسانید؛ فرصت تخلیه را ده دقیقه باز نگه می‌دارم.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-brief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.92,
      "sha256": "2f2259d4a375f7ffea4db7080d9fb1e37ed8eb3e3ba4e9e0df7762e258da0b5e",
      "captionSha256": "4ad537f17cf9c8e361ea96d0b7d898e86084eedc483288becb728537b2a7f239"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Two medics and two engineers are stranded by the western road. They are the people who can reopen the clinics and restore the network. Bring every one of them home.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.96,
      "sha256": "e0916ad31775309356789665928c4a2fd23b5234bda4104a6a4a1ec328ddfba1",
      "captionSha256": "45ef9b6f843f0f9c75c5a1e2660ca88c3ebec80c267ac18f92bdc8cf825e0453"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "دو امدادگر و دو مهندس کنار جادهٔ غربی گرفتار شده‌اند. آن‌ها می‌توانند درمانگاه‌ها را باز کنند و شبکه را بازگردانند. همه را سالم برگردانید.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-brief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.52,
      "sha256": "eb50844664ef78acb86cd36af25a1bc7bc54446296ef3d37ed8821bf94c083a7",
      "captionSha256": "5c0ab439a8858a023024076de0cd701aef68de0ce05add1b6f07c132f22d33c5"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Rifles cover the road; the APC carries the team. Unload beside Laila, board the helicopter, hold the area clear for twenty seconds, then fly to the marked departure zone.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.4,
      "sha256": "040d905b5684e93d19049ae05c99c7f819b6954923a4662ae8d23b583d3cc4f7",
      "captionSha256": "c49e168afea1a0945ffc136636463e9d9e1e838e635fc11135be208c525e85cc"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-brief-03",
      "speaker": "DALIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "تفنگدارها جاده را پوشش می‌دهند؛ نفربر تیم را منتقل می‌کند. کنار لیلا پیاده شوید، سوار بالگرد شوید، بیست ثانیه محل را امن نگه دارید و سپس به محدودهٔ خروج پرواز کنید.",
      "voiceId": "MK1Zvh93428YrgOQ8Obr",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Major Dalia Rahim",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-brief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 15.12,
      "sha256": "e562bfc044250287ad5ffb7e60029c21d8b2345444c8550e352064143d6c94b2",
      "captionSha256": "e880892e3e298406df2a1ac93b48d1c57f7b2223d9d0491bda481209d3fee81c"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-comms-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "All four are aboard. The landing area is clear and departure is authorized. Fly to the marked exit; I will take the team from there.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 8.8,
      "sha256": "46684acd4720bced8502730cc11cf2f5bd106db048cb24a56e8c5a9fadc3426f",
      "captionSha256": "4264e58e6906898c295ee60095703dd6c43c599803984ca8702bcb1f20aceece"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-comms-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "هر چهار نفر سوار شده‌اند. محل فرود امن است و اجازهٔ خروج داریم. به محل خروج مشخص‌شده پرواز کنید؛ از آنجا تیم را منتقل می‌کنم.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-comms-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 11.68,
      "sha256": "0768009ef6270234b3c50a4b08a2ff053a4467511cca6ffb1b12890b831382f6",
      "captionSha256": "9d2c3e4f82620f35aac9c4d172e37dae112d5f7f4dcfb4dc036890a515820224"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Four passengers accounted for. Your escort gave us the time we needed. I am joining this operation; you will have an airlift pilot when the next team needs a way out.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-debrief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.6,
      "sha256": "4a483f98d5bb2744dcc98b7acf4c72a610dd688a27e34a9c4e147419995ec385",
      "captionSha256": "110164ca9977629cb3c4637f83dbf0a909fdd85290ab9a61d67532dbf8aab068"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-01",
      "speaker": "LAILA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "هر چهار مسافر حاضرند. پوشش شما زمان لازم را فراهم کرد. به این عملیات می‌پیوندم؛ از این پس برای نجات تیم بعدی یک خلبان ترابری هوایی خواهید داشت.",
      "voiceId": "EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL",
      "voiceName": "Sarah - Mature, Reassuring, Confident (Captain Laila Nasser)",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-debrief-01.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.72,
      "sha256": "72b717053914ec939e413a66c74c42115bbe4ce9e25ddfeaf2ec64b18dd7d087",
      "captionSha256": "7bdf260bce52e917fd8582abf6f63f229d90e9d26d6e19cf47a7d31018f92eee"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "The engineers brought their repair records. Several outages lead back to the same fortified communications node. We finally have a place to investigate.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 9.12,
      "sha256": "11fc27dacd27e921068fcf0f4f8e32e3e9e6600725b181f03cda1d1c05351516",
      "captionSha256": "7ca338c3752915ff61fd895e46af199f525eec809d1bc45c65b70739e371054c"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-02",
      "speaker": "SAMIRA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "مهندسان سوابق تعمیر را آورده‌اند. چند قطعی به یک گرهٔ ارتباطی مستحکم برمی‌گردد. سرانجام محلی برای بررسی داریم.",
      "voiceId": "7uxeJ73HfJL9gOH2mttA",
      "voiceName": "Warline - Engineer Samira Haddad",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-debrief-02.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.08,
      "sha256": "145de36bb4377fa2a7bb679e07d02706abf85d68828157d710cd6316fa1e5e21",
      "captionSha256": "31da0d825fc119b653c9600e319b0e1860e27d034ce5adce85d79ec9936fd4de"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "en-US",
      "text": "Extraction confirmed. Captain Nasser is on the roster. Next objective: assess that communications node. First, let the medical team get back to work.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/en/m04-debrief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 10.64,
      "sha256": "75aebdebc5fe9ad1e7f73cab8be5b6753404b56ab85f36209cbfec4b8c017a45",
      "captionSha256": "8944004d9b2cebe4344730c622edd276e00b611ace6b1809dc5f75667cdab59d"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrative",
      "id": "m04-debrief-03",
      "speaker": "ARIA",
      "locale": "fa-IR",
      "text": "تخلیه تأیید شد. سروان ناصر به گروه پیوست. هدف بعدی: بررسی آن گرهٔ ارتباطی. ابتدا بگذارید تیم پزشکی به کارش برگردد.",
      "voiceId": "Fi9tPTnEcbh3of7hOHC8",
      "voiceName": "Warline - ARIA Civic Relay",
      "assetPath": "Assets/Game/Audio/Narrative/M04Airlift/Voice/fa/m04-debrief-03.wav",
      "durationSeconds": 12.48,
      "sha256": "5e00bcf18709c45e22418ece9a01e841a75881bf71f0ce3ff87f07e27e05b0e5",
      "captionSha256": "f3be234b5d6dec7bca7d035a14dc5f0ff44b708c439649526dcce053b03900ee"
